      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright 2003 Wiley-Liss, Inc.",
        "AbstractText": "Even in the drug-eluting stent era, percutaneous coronary intervention in bifurcation lesions is complex and technically demanding, and considerable expertise is required. This case report describes in-stent restenosis due to stent underexpansion after kissing stents using sirolimus-eluting stents."
      },
